382	 *  sheet's today was settled, added up — times their share divided by 100, added up and rounded half to even;
383	 *  0.00 with none), and a picker that names one more. Naming themselves, or a patron twice, is refused. */
384	function PersonPatrons({ sheetId, personId }: { sheetId: string; personId: number }) {
